flowchart TD
    Start([Start])
    OpenPage[User opens Top Up page]
    ViewWallet[System retrieves user's wallet]
    CheckStatus{Is wallet ACTIVE?}

    ErrorStatus[Display wallet status error]
    InputAmount[User enters Top Up amount]
    Submit[User submits Top Up request]

    Validate{Is amount valid and greater than zero?}
    ErrorAmount[Display invalid amount error]

    BeginTransaction[Begin database transaction]
    GenerateReference[System generates unique transaction reference]
    UpdateBalance[System increases wallet balance]
    CreateTransaction[System creates TOP_UP transaction record]
    SaveData[(Save wallet and transaction data)]
    Commit[Commit database transaction]

    Success[Display Top Up success and updated balance]

    Rollback[Rollback database transaction]
    ErrorSystem[Display Top Up failure message]

    End([End])

    Start --> OpenPage
    OpenPage --> ViewWallet
    ViewWallet --> CheckStatus

    CheckStatus -- No --> ErrorStatus
    ErrorStatus --> End

    CheckStatus -- Yes --> InputAmount
    InputAmount --> Submit
    Submit --> Validate

    Validate -- No --> ErrorAmount
    ErrorAmount --> InputAmount

    Validate -- Yes --> BeginTransaction
    BeginTransaction --> GenerateReference
    GenerateReference --> UpdateBalance
    UpdateBalance --> CreateTransaction
    CreateTransaction --> SaveData
    SaveData --> Commit
    Commit --> Success
    Success --> End

    UpdateBalance -. Database error .-> Rollback
    CreateTransaction -. Database error .-> Rollback
    SaveData -. Database error .-> Rollback
    Rollback --> ErrorSystem
    ErrorSystem --> End